{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the warm-up climb. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This free demo gives you the first slice of This Is Why We Don\u2019t Play Golf, the chaotic co-op physics platformer where every \u201cI got it!\u201d is a lie. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll haul your golf ball up the mountain one cursed swing at a time, with the mountain itself, and maybe your friend, plotting against you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s in the demo: The opening region of the mountain, packed with warm, welcoming hazards. Local/online co-op enabled! Bring a friend to double the \u201cfun.\u201d </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough rage fuel to prepare you for the full climb. Add the full game to your wishlist to unlock 4 regions, longer climbs, and even more creative vocabulary expansion.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987470?t=1758125017","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987470?t=1758125017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987470/7d01b104d9c6b419d2532d6b24fa42746536e6a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758125017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987470/7d01b104d9c6b419d2532d6b24fa42746536e6a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758125017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":7